add('ir-conditions',4,'Results, Ir/Pt paragraph','protocol_variant','Ir synthesis uses the named (methylcyclopentadienyl)(1,5-cyclooctadiene)iridium(I) precursor at 3.3 mM, thiol/precursor 7.6:1, 80 °C and 276 bar. Exact precursor mass, source-assigned batch ID, yield and quantitative size distribution are unreported.')
