conclusions=[
'Ag, Ir and Pt particles and their acetone/fluorinated-solvent redispersion are summarized. The claimed first synthesis in pure CO2 is historical author framing, not an externally verified modern novelty claim.',
'Future candidate precursors should dissolve in CO2, remain stable at moderate temperature and decompose upon H2 addition. Higher temperatures or stronger reductants are proposed if H2 fails; these are outlook conditions, not performed additional experiments.',
'The ligand should interact favorably with solvent while binding weakly enough to permit growth and strongly enough to arrest it. No universal optimized binding energy or ligand-selection model is measured.',
'The authors summarize mean Ag sizes 26–107 Å, approximately size-independent broad dispersity and distribution self-similarity as evidence for predominantly coagulative growth.',
'C8 fluorinated ligands provide in-reaction control but insufficient redispersibility in pure CO2 after isolation, whereas the cited C10 ligands stabilize more effectively. Stronger attraction in low-polarizability CO2 is the authors’ explanation; alternatives remain source-scoped.'
]
for n,t in enumerate(conclusions,1):add(f'conclusion-{n:02}',7,'Conclusions','author_summary_or_outlook',t)
