('fig4-point-count','Figure 4 caption D–G names four conditions but shows five plotted points, including two at70°C. A possible H-like value is not a verified sample assignment.',[3]),
('hamaker-co2-state','The modeled1.4eV interaction is called sc-CO2 at25°C although the introduction states31°C critical temperature. Retain the reported model context and conflict; do not use25°C as reaction temperature.',[1,5]),
('fluorinated-length','Source formulas specify six versus eight fluorinated carbons, while prose says the current fluorinated part is20%shorter. Preserve both rather than silently substitute25% or change formulas.',[5]),
('percent-dispersity','Tabulated percentages are source values and need not exactly equal100×rounded SD/rounded mean. Do not recompute or silently overwrite the published percent column.',[2]),
('population-scope','Abstract/conclusion20–120Å is a broad family description; histograms extend toward200Å and individual samplemeans differ. Do not interpret20–120Å as a strict min/max for every particle or an Ir/Ptmean.',[1,4,6]),
('cohort-joins','Figures2/6/11 lackA–I sample labels. Figure7i59Å matchesTableFmean but has no explicitFjoin; keep opticalcohortdistinct. Figure8hasmaterial-specificIr/Ptmethodassociation but noauthorbatchIDs.',[3,4,6,7]),
('volume-bases','27mL workingcell,14–18mLCO2fill,100/200µLthiolloop and800µLH2loop are different quantities. No per-row precursor mass or exact gaspartialpressure should be derived from them.',[2]),
